# Finite tables for `D₃ = U₃`

Generated by `explorer/fib-walk/gen_three_main.py`. These are explicit tables of the down- and
up-integers below `310`, each checked against `downB`/`upB` (from `Small.lean`, correct below `377`)
by `decide +kernel`. They give the finite facts that `Three/Main.lean` needs:
* every window that starts at a member `N < 105` and runs to the third member after it has length
  in `S₃ = {3,4,5,6,7,8,10,11,13}`;
* explicit witnesses for each `g ∈ S₃`, for both down- and up-integers.
-/

